<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 321 million in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 321 million in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to October 31 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to October 25  SPFC:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 36,703	 37,024</p>
<p> Money market intervention    10,683	 11,803</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		5,982	  5,998</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,419	  2,422</p>
<p> Total assets		     63,753	 65,243</p>
<p>In the previous week, to October 25, reserves fell by 65 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
